  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 86,
  "text_len": 33
 },
 {
  "id": "sce040:0007B",
  "jp": "ヤマト「トウヤとは違うから大丈夫じゃニャい？{nl}　それにガボンだってそのへんは考えてるだろうし」",
  "off": 123,
  "len": 56,
  "en": "Yamato: She's nyot like you, Touya, so she should be fine, nya? Besides, Gabon's probably got that covered.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 125,
  "text_len": 53
 },
 {
